"goonda" means a person, who either by himself or as a member of or leader of a gang, habitually commits, or attempts
to commit or abets the commission of offences punishable under Chapter or Chapter XVII or Chapter XXII of the Indian
Penal Code;
(h)
"Government" means the State Government of Andhra Pradesh ;
